   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Beaumont Rag**: back after 56 archived shows (642 days) [2]\n- **A Letter to Seymour**: back after 71 archived shows (679 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **A Good Woman's Love**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **If You Ever Change Your Mind**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **She Makes My Love**: back after 74 archived shows (685 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-12-03.akg483.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 143 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were clamped on the balcony about 15 feet above the floor, near the center-front position (DFC) [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-12-03.akg483.flac16**: taped by Larry Pillman; transferred by Larry Pillman; source: AKG 483 > Tascam DR-680 MKII 24/48 [1]. Also: Transfer chain: Tascam to Wavelab 6.0 for resampling and dither, CDWave for tracking, then FLAC level 6. Taped and transferred by Larry Pillman [1]",
